@host = {{host}}

### Resource reads
GET {{host}}/api/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Administrator mutations: copy created resource ID to resourceId (201)
POST {{host}}/api/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lab Desk",
  "type": "DESK",
  "location": "Floor 2",
  "capacity": 1
}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Desk",
  "type": "DESK",
  "location": "Floor 2",
  "capacity": 2
}

###
PATCH {{host}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "MAINTENANCE"
}

### Create a second resource (201); copy its ID to deletableResourceId
POST {{host}}/api/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Disposable Desk",
  "type": "DESK",
  "location": "Floor 4",
  "capacity": 1
}

### Delete second resource before any booking (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/resources/{{deletableResourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### No bearer token: unauthenticated API (401)
GET {{host}}/api/resources

### Valid employee bearer token, no UI session (200)
GET {{host}}/api/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### URL security: employee cannot create resource (403)
POST {{host}}/api/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Forbidden Desk",
  "type": "DESK",
  "location": "Floor 3",
  "capacity": 1
}

### Method security: employee cannot change status (403)
PATCH {{host}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OUT_OF_SERVICE"
}

### Restore AVAILABLE before reservation scenarios (200)
PATCH {{host}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### Reservation: employee creates active booking (201); copy response id to reservationId
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "{{resourceId}}",
  "startTime": "{{startTime}}",
  "endTime": "{{endTime}}"
}

### Same resource and interval: overlap (409)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "{{resourceId}}",
  "startTime": "{{startTime}}",
  "endTime": "{{endTime}}"
}

### Adjacent interval: no overlap (201); copy response id to adminReservationId
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "{{resourceId}}",
  "startTime": "{{endTime}}",
  "endTime": "{{adjacentEndTime}}"
}

### Async confirmation: owner receives combined calendar/access results (200)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}/confirmation
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Invalid zero-length interval (400)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "{{resourceId}}",
  "startTime": "{{startTime}}",
  "endTime": "{{startTime}}"
}

### Employee sees only own bookings (200)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Employee cannot cancel administrator booking (403)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/{{adminReservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Owner cancels booking (200); repeat returns 409
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Resource with reservation history cannot be deleted (409)
DELETE {{host}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
